gs and electrical loads — that mall management and Kuwait Municipality request for digital signage installations. Local sign-off is coordinated with your fit-out contractor.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What after-sales support is available in Kuwait?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Every project includes remote monitoring and diagnostics, spare-module packs delivered with the installation, and scheduled maintenance visits from our regional team. Critical faults are triaged remotely the same day.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"WebPage\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"LED Display Kuwait | 55\\\\u00b0C-Rated Screens, Factory-Direct | Brightluxx\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Factory-direct LED displays for Kuwait \\\\u2014 outdoor screens rated for 55\\\\u00b0C summers, indoor from KD 200/m\\\\u00b2. Delivered to Kuwait City in 5\\\\u201310 days with warranty & spares.\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/kuwait\\\", \\\"publisher\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\\\"}}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"LED Display Kuwait | 55\\\\u00b0C-Rated Screens, Factory-Direct | Brightluxx\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/kuwait\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}]],\"$L10\"]}]\n11:Tbeb,<h1>LED Display Kuwait | 55°C-Rated Screens, Factory-Direct | Brightluxx</h1><p>Factory-direct LED displays for Kuwait — outdoor screens rated for 55°C summers, indoor from KD 200/m². Delivered to Kuwait City in 5–10 days with warranty &amp; spares.</p><h2>Kuwait Areas We Serve</h2><ul><li><strong>Kuwait City CBD</strong>: Bank and corporate tower lobbies along the waterfront business district.</li><li><strong>Salmiya</strong>: Retail strips and mall storefront displays on Salem Al Mubarak Street.</li><li><strong>Al Rai &amp; The Avenues</strong>: Kuwait's largest mall district — window-facing and atrium LED.</li><li><strong>Hawally</strong>: Commercial and clinic signage across the district.</li><li><strong>Ahmadi &amp; Fahaheel</strong>: Energy-sector facilities and southern retail centres.</li></ul><h2>Kuwait Signage Regulations &amp; Power</h2><h3>Kuwait Municipality Advertising Licence</h3><p>External digital advertising requires a municipality licence with size and placement conditions — we provide the technical documentation your local agent submits.</p><h3>MEW Electrical Approval</h3><p>Screens are specified to Ministry of Electricity &amp; Water supply standards with approved load sheets for larger installations.</p><h3>Extreme-Heat Specification</h3><p>Kuwait summers exceed 55°C — we specify high-temperature LEDs, oversized heat-sinking and derated power supplies so warranties remain valid year-round.</p><h2>LED Display FAQs — Kuwait</h2><h3>Do you supply and install LED screens in Kuwait City?</h3><p>Yes — Kuwait is served by GCC road freight from Dubai, typically 5 to 10 days door-to-door including customs. Our engineers travel for surveys and supervise installation with trained local crews.</p><h3>Can your outdoor screens handle Kuwait's summer heat?</h3><p>Yes — our outdoor panels are rated for continuous operation at ambient temperatures above 55°C, with high-temperature LEDs, oversized heat-sinking and optional active cooling. Brightness sensors adjust output automatically to remain visible in extreme summer glare.</p><h3>What is the typical cost of an LED screen in Kuwait?</h3><p>Pricing mirrors our UAE rates plus freight — indoor fine-pitch walls from roughly KD 200 per square metre and outdoor advertising screens from KD 150 per square metre, depending on pitch and structure. Detailed quotations are provided within 24 hours of receiving site dimensions.</p><h3>Do you handle mall and retail signage approvals in Kuwait?</h3><p>We provide the technical documentation — brightness reports, structural drawings and electrical loads — that mall management and Kuwait Municipality request for digital signage installations. Local sign-off is coordinated with your fit-out contractor.</p><h3>What after-sales support is available in Kuwait?</h3><p>Every project includes remote monitoring and diagnostics, spare-module packs delivered with the installation, and scheduled maintenance visits from our regional team. Critical faults are triaged remotely the same day.</p>10:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$11\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"LED Display Kuwait | 55°C-Rated Screens, Factory-Direct | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Factory-direct LED displays for Kuwait — outdoor screens rated for 55°C summers, indoor from KD 200/m². Delivered to Kuwait City in 5–10 days with warranty & spares.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"